# Shadowsocks Sample Collection

## Protocol: Shadowsocks

### Sample 1: Basic Configuration
```json
{
  "name": "ss-basic",
  "format": "uri",
  "link": "ss://YWVzLTI1Ni1nY206dGVzdC1wYXNzd29yZA==@example.com:8388#Test-SS-Node",
  "description": "Standard Shadowsocks with AES-256-GCM",
  "expected_ir": {
    "protocol": "shadowsocks",
    "name": "Test-SS-Node",
    "server": {
      "host": "example.com",
      "port": 8388
    },
    "proto": {
      "method": "aes-256-gcm",
      "password": "test-password",
      "udp": true
    }
  }
}
```

### Sample 2: With Plugin (obfs)
```json
{
  "name": "ss-obfs",
  "format": "uri",
  "link": "ss://YWVzLTI1Ni1nY206dGVzdC1wYXNzd29yZA==@example.com:8388?plugin=obfs-local%3Bobfs%3Dhttp%3Bobfs-host%3Dwww.bing.com#SS-Obfs",
  "description": "Shadowsocks with obfs plugin",
  "expected_ir": {
    "protocol": "shadowsocks",
    "name": "SS-Obfs",
    "server": {
      "host": "example.com",
      "port": 8388
    },
    "proto": {
      "method": "aes-256-gcm",
      "password": "test-password",
      "plugin": "obfs-local",
      "plugin_opts": "obfs=http;obfs-host=www.bing.com",
      "udp": true
    }
  }
}
```

### Sample 3: 2022 Edition
```json
{
  "name": "ss-2022",
  "format": "uri",
  "link": "ss://MjAyMi1ibGFrZTMtYWVzLTI1Ni1nY206dGVzdC1rZXk=@test.example.com:8388#SS-2022",
  "description": "Shadowsocks 2022 with blake3",
  "expected_ir": {
    "protocol": "shadowsocks",
    "name": "SS-2022",
    "server": {
      "host": "test.example.com",
      "port": 8388
    },
    "proto": {
      "method": "2022-blake3-aes-256-gcm",
      "password": "test-key",
      "udp": true
    }
  }
}
```
